<title>UK: Shield Diagnostics places shrs at 530p/shr.</title>
<headline>Shield Diagnostics places shrs at 530p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Shield Diagnostics Group confirmed on Friday that it had placed new 550,000 shares at a price of 530 pence per share to raise 2.9 million stg.</p>
<p>The company said the money would be used to fund acquisitions of product licenses within the cardiovascular testing market.</p>
<p>Shield placed 545,000 shares with institutions and 5,000 with David Evans, its finance director.</p>
<p>Its share price earlier fell 40 pence to 555p on press reports suggesting its placement plan.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
